  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/factory-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a> \n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffactory-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a> \n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"fabric\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\"></a> \n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"forge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\"></a> \n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fquiltmc.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"quilt\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_vector.svg\"></a></p><h1>🥽 關於</h1><p><strong>一個為開發者和資源包製作者提供多種客戶端與伺服器端功能的API，其中包括：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>UI定義系統：可透過資源包（主要功能）或程式碼新增或修改介面與GUI的無數元素</li>\n<li>核心事件系統：多數事件直接抽象自模組載入器</li>\n<li>通用網路架構：以統一方式發送與註冊資料傳輸，幾乎無需因支援版本不同而修改</li>\n<li>跨模組載入器的物品/流體/能量儲存通用實現，並為相應API提供正確的暴露接口</li>\n<li>區塊光照等級存取方案（僅在Fabric實現，Forge與NeoForge已內建此功能）</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
